  "holistic_F_N": 2,
  "holistic_F_H": -2,
  "section_notes": "S1 is strict on reporting and customer notice. S2 sets a 5% failure limit but does not automatically stop sales above it, leaving restrictions to regulator discretion. S3 and S4 land in the acceptable range with a 6-year retrofit and 36-month suppression deadline, while S5 retains a mandatory 8/100k recall trigger that would apply to Halcyon's Ember 8."
